        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DVD150HMRSAL, Hammered Davidson Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHand crafted by the master craftsmen at First Impressions, the Hammered Davison Door Pull is a truly unique and beautiful piece. This pull has a very now look that many designers are using to add texture into modern spaces. The Davidson Door Handle is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. Choose from a huge selection of finishes, we recommend polished chrome or black. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DVD01-detail.jpg?v=1704354723\" width=\"600\" height=\"216\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions DVD150HMRSAL Detailed View\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Davidson Series 1 Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DVD01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262335\"><b>First Impressions DVD150HMRSAL Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>DVD150018HMRSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DVD150024HMRSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DVD150036HMRSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
